# ---------------------------------------------------------------- privacy --
# This project builds a face-recognition system. Nothing derived from a real
# person's face belongs in a public repository, ever — not the images, and not
# the embeddings, which are biometric data under UK GDPR and are not anonymous
# just because they look like a float array.
vision/targets/*.npz
# ...and any subdirectory. A bare *.npz glob does NOT match nested paths, and
# moving a session into targets/sessions/ silently escaped it once (2026-08-20).
vision/targets/**/*.npz
vision/enrol/
vision/captures/
vision/camera_test.jpg
vision/docs/hud_*.png
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi

# Demo media that HAS been cleared for publication lives in docs/media/ and is
# force-added. See docs/PRIVACY.md.

# --------------------------------------------------- third-party material --
# Manufacturer datasheets and reference schematics are not ours to
# redistribute. docs/vendor/SOURCES.md links to each one and records exactly
# which fact in this repository came from which document.
docs/vendor/*.pdf

# ------------------------------------------------------------ large blobs --
# ~295 MB of ONNX weights. Fetched by vision/fetch_models.py, and two of them
# are over GitHub's 100 MB hard limit anyway.
vision/models/

# ---------------------------------------------------- build + environments --
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/

firmware/.pio/
firmware/.vscode/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ KiCad --
# Backups, caches and lock files. The board and schematic themselves ARE
# tracked — they are generated by scripts/, but a reviewer without KiCad
# installed still needs to be able to see them.
*-backups/
*.kicad_prl
*.kicad_pro.lck
fp-info-cache
~*.kicad_*
*_autosave*
\#auto_saved_files\#

# Editor history plugin — 4.7 MB of every intermediate save, and it carries its
# own nested .git which confuses tooling.
.history/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------- system --
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets --
# The SoftAP passphrase. Anything joined to the drone's network can send it
# flight commands, so this is a real credential, not a formality.
firmware/include/secrets.h

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- training --
# The venv and the model checkpoint. history.json and eval.npz ARE tracked —
# they are the evidence, and they are small.
ml/.venv/
ml/runs/*.pt

# SKiDL hook artefacts — the plugin drops these wherever it is invoked
skidl_REPL.erc
skidl_REPL.log
